{"id":"37a91d4613e30b36","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-weil-representation.md","title":"Weil Covariance Data (Legacy Label)","display":"df-weil-representation — Weil Covariance Data (Legacy Label)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weil-representation","aliases":["58-df-weil-representation"],"display":"df-weil-representation — Weil Covariance Data (Legacy Label)","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weil-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weil-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weil-representation — Weil Covariance Data (Legacy Label)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"413736d776e8d283\" href=\"?note=413736d776e8d283\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md\">../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n\\coloneqq L^2(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal H_n\\coloneqq L^2(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_n\\coloneqq U(\\mathcal H_n)\">\\(\\mathcal U_n\\coloneqq U(\\mathcal H_n)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"413736d776e8d283\" href=\"?note=413736d776e8d283\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md\">../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S(\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_H(\\langle e_H,z\\rangle)=z\\land\\cdot_H(\\langle z,e_H\\rangle)=z\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\omega,M,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\omega(e_M)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\omega(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\omega(g)\\circ\\omega(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\rho(e_H)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall z,w\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\rho(\\cdot_H(\\langle z,w\\rangle))=\\rho(z)\\circ\\rho(w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,M,H^H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;(\\alpha(e_M)(z)=z)\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\alpha(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\alpha(g)\\circ\\alpha(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall g\\in M\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\omega(g)\\circ\\rho(z)\\circ\\omega(g)^{-1}=\\rho(\\alpha(g)(z))\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S(\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_H(\\langle e_H,z\\rangle)=z\\land\\cdot_H(\\langle z,e_H\\rangle)=z\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\omega,M,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\omega(e_M)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\omega(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\omega(g)\\circ\\omega(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\rho(e_H)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall z,w\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\rho(\\cdot_H(\\langle z,w\\rangle))=\\rho(z)\\circ\\rho(w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,M,H^H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;(\\alpha(e_M)(z)=z)\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\alpha(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\alpha(g)\\circ\\alpha(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall g\\in M\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\omega(g)\\circ\\rho(z)\\circ\\omega(g)^{-1}=\\rho(\\alpha(g)(z))\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>上式只定义相对于“给定群 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>、表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 与 metaplectic 作用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>”的协变酉表示数据；现有依赖不足以把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 规范识别为 Heisenberg 群，也不足以把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 规范识别为 Schrödinger 表示。</li>\n<li>补齐这些两个规范性上游后，协变子句才把 Weil 表示与任意 metaplectic 酉表示区分开。</li>\n<li>Automorphic forms: theta series <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(z, \\tau)\">\\(\\theta(z, \\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In general a Weil representation is genuinely metaplectic and need not descend to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sp(2n)\">\\(Sp(2n)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"413736d776e8d283","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"413736d776e8d283","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n\\coloneqq L^2(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_n\\coloneqq U(\\mathcal H_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{WeilCovarianceData}_S(\\omega,n,\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\cdot_H(\\langle e_H,z\\rangle)=z\\land\\cdot_H(\\langle z,e_H\\rangle)=z\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi,n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\omega,M,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\omega(e_M)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\omega(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\omega(g)\\circ\\omega(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H,\\mathcal U_n)\\land\\rho(e_H)=I_{\\mathcal H_n}\\land\\forall z,w\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\rho(\\cdot_H(\\langle z,w\\rangle))=\\rho(z)\\circ\\rho(w)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,M,H^H)\\land\\forall z\\in H\\;(\\alpha(e_M)(z)=z)\\land\\forall g,h\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\alpha(\\cdot_M(\\langle g,h\\rangle))=\\alpha(g)\\circ\\alpha(h)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall g\\in M\\;\\forall z\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\omega(g)\\circ\\rho(z)\\circ\\omega(g)^{-1}=\\rho(\\alpha(g)(z))\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(z, \\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"Sp(2n)","display":false}],"bytes":2587,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1386","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-weil-representation.md|58-df-weil-representation]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["413736d776e8d283","ed71f39f59370734","36d7463d215be751"]}